	skos:definition "Refers to the Indice Camara Promedio ('ICP') rate for Chilean Pesos which, for a Reset Date, is determined and published by the Asociacion de Bancos e Instituciones Financieras de Chile A.G. ('ABIF') in accordance with the 'Reglamento Indice de Camara Promedio' of the ABIF as published in the Diario Oficial de la Republica de Chile (the 'ICP Rules') and which is reported on the ABIF website by not later than 10:00 a.m., Santiago time, on that Reset Date." .
